"什么都不需要配置。没有该扩展时，在 ``.vscode/mcp.json`` 中："

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:78
msgid "Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Claude Desktop"

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:80
msgid ""
"Claude Desktop starts servers from no particular directory, so name the "
"package with an absolute path, in ``claude_desktop_config.json``:"
msgstr ""
"Claude Desktop 启动服务器时并不处在某个特定目录下，所以请在 ``claude_desktop_config.json`` "
"中用绝对路径指名那个包："

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:92
msgid "The MCP Registry"
msgstr "MCP Registry"

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:94
msgid ""
"The server is listed in the `MCP Registry "
"<https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io>`_ as "
"``io.github.partcad/partcad``, which is what clients that install servers "
"from the registry find. Such a client runs it as ``uvx partcad mcp``, and "
"offers ``PC_PATH`` for the package to serve."
msgstr ""
"该服务器以 ``io.github.partcad/partcad`` 的名义列在 `MCP Registry "
"<https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io>`_ "
"中，那些从注册表安装服务器的客户端找到的就是它。这样的客户端会以 ``uvx partcad mcp`` 来运行它，并提供 ``PC_PATH`` "
"用于指定要服务的那个包。"

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:100
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../source/ai_agents/mcp.rst:102
msgid ""
"Each tool is one daemon method, with the parameters the ``pc`` command it "
"mirrors sends. The ones that name an object -- ``info``, ``render``, "
"``export``, ``test``, ``bom`` and ``instructions`` -- take ``params``, the "
"values of the object's own parameters by name, which is ``-p "
"<name>=<value>`` on the command line (see :ref:`parameter-values`)."
msgstr ""
"每个工具都是一个守护进程方法，带着它所对应的那条 ``pc`` 命令会发送的参数。那些需要指名对象的工具 -- "
"``info``、``render``、``export``、``test``、``bom`` 和 ``instructions`` -- 都接受 "
"``params`` ，也就是按名称给出的该对象自身参数的取值，这在命令行上对应 ``-p <name>=<value>`` （参见 "
":ref:`parameter-values` ）。"

